Package: nvfancontrol
Version: 1.1.0
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: 841973620 <admin@841973620.net>
Depends: bash, kmod, make, gcc, util-linux
Suggests: dkms
Description: DGX Spark persistent EC fan sysfs controller
 The module exposes a fan sysfs attribute that accepts either
 the 100% fan override or the EC automatic thermal policy, a writable
 fan_override attribute for direct EC override-slot testing, and a
 thermal_zone/cooling_device pair (nvfancontrol_ec/nvfancontrol_fan)
 that lets the kernel's step_wise governor drive the fans from a
 host-tunable curve, opt-in via standard thermal sysfs.
